<h1 id="sec:第二章">2 第二章</h1>
<h1 id="sec:第三章">3 第三章</h1>
<p>参见 图 <a href="#fig:architecture">3-1</a>、图 <a href="#fig:next">3-2</a>、表 <a href="#tbl:comparison">3-1</a> 和 表 <a href="#tbl:next">3-2</a>。</p>
<figure id="fig:architecture">
<img src="../crossrefs/figure.svg" style="width:45.0%" alt="MT-MoE ViT 网络架构图">
<figcaption><span class="caption-primary">图 3-1 MT-MoE ViT
网络架构图</span>
<span class="caption-en" lang="en">Fig. 3-1 Architecture diagram of the
<em>MT-MoE ViT</em> network with <span class="math inline">\alpha</span></span></figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="fig:next">
<img src="../crossrefs/figure.svg" style="width:45.0%" alt="图 3-2 后续单语图">
<figcaption aria-hidden="true">图 3-2 后续单语图</figcaption>
</figure>
<table id="tbl:comparison" data-revision_rows="*" data-cell_margin="0.10cm" data-autofit="window" style="--pmt-table-cell-margin-top: 2.8346pt; --pmt-table-cell-margin-right: 2.8346pt; --pmt-table-cell-margin-bottom: 2.8346pt; --pmt-table-cell-margin-left: 2.8346pt;">
<caption><span class="caption-primary">表 3-1 模型性能对比</span>
<span class="caption-en" lang="en">Table 3-1 Performance comparison of
<strong>different models</strong></span></caption>
<thead>
<tr>
<th data-custom-style="Revision Char">模型</th>
<th data-custom-style="Revision Char">得分</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td data-custom-style="Revision Char">A</td>
<td data-custom-style="Revision Char">95</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td data-custom-style="Revision Char">B</td>
<td data-custom-style="Revision Char">96</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<table id="tbl:next" data-autofit="window">
<caption>表 3-2 后续单语表</caption>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>项目</th>
<th>值</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>A</td>
<td>1</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<h1 id="sec:第四章">4 第四章</h1>
<figure id="fig:chapter">
<img src="../crossrefs/figure.svg" style="width:45.0%" alt="新章节图">
